  "body": "What happens: the status strip label formats the operation count as\n\"{ops_n} Operations\". With one operation it reads \"1 Operations\".\nExpected: it reads \"1 Operation\". Two or more keep the plural.\nEvidence: crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs (the format!(\"{ops_n} Operations\")\nlabel in the status strip). The review of PR #2278 noted it.\nDone means: the strip shows \"1 Operation\" for one operation and the\nstructural test asserts both forms.\nFound while reviewing #2262 (PR #2278).\n",
